  "kind": "ETDF",
  "text_count": 97,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "It's...boiling!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6424,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Está... hirviendo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "So that means we can't take a\nbath...",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6440,
      "_bytes": 37,
      "translation": "O sea, que no podemos\nbañarnos..."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "But it's nice and warm here!",
      "speaker_id": 2521,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6478,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "¡Pero aquí se está calentito!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "In any case, it's not cold\nanymore.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6507,
      "_bytes": 35,
      "translation": "Por lo menos ya no hace frío."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "How can you be so calm about this?\nWhat are we gonna do about food?\nFood and...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6543,
      "_bytes": 79,
      "translation": "¿Cómo podéis estar tan\ntranquilos? ¿Qué hacemos con la\ncomida? La comida y..."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "There's food, look!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6623,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¡Mirad, hay comida!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "There's food, look!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6643,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¡Mirad, hay comida!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "There's food, look!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6663,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¡Mirad, hay comida!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "!!",
      "speaker_id": 9001,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6683,
      "_bytes": 2,
      "translation": "!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Why is there a refrigerator in a\nplace like this?!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6686,
      "_bytes": 50,
      "translation": "¡¿Qué hace una nevera en un\nsitio como este?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Ahhh! We're in luck!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6737,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "¡Aaah! ¡Qué suerte!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "This is ridiculous! It's absurd...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6758,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "¡Esto es ridículo! Es absurdo..."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Wait! I can't leave until I make\nsure what's in that fridge!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6793,
      "_bytes": 60,
      "translation": "¡Esperad! ¡No me voy sin saber\nqué hay en esa nevera!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "What's in there?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6854,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "¿Qué hay dentro?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "All right! Let's open it!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6871,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¡Venga! ¡Vamos a abrirla!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "All right! Let's open it!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6897,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¡Venga! ¡Vamos a abrirla!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "All right! Let's open it!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6923,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¡Venga! ¡Vamos a abrirla!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "!!",
      "speaker_id": 9001,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6949,
      "_bytes": 2,
      "translation": "!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Eggs!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6952,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡Huevos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Looks like this'll be today's\ndinner!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6958,
      "_bytes": 37,
      "translation": "¡Será la cena de esta noche!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Wait a minute! We can't just go\naround eating other people's\nfood...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6996,
      "_bytes": 68,
      "translation": "¡Espera! No puedes ir por ahí\ncomiéndote la comida de otra\ngente..."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Wouldn't that just make us\nburglars?",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7065,
      "_bytes": 36,
      "translation": "¿No nos haría eso ser unos\nladrones?"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "But we're hungry, so this is our\nonly option.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7102,
      "_bytes": 45,
      "translation": "Pero tenemos hambre, esta es la\núnica opción."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "If we tell the owners about our\nproblem, they'll understand.",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7148,
      "_bytes": 60,
      "translation": "Si se lo decimos a los\npropietarios, lo\nentenderán."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "At any rate, it's an emergency\nsituation.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7209,
      "_bytes": 41,
      "translation": "Sea como sea, es una\nemergencia."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7251,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 2721,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7255,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7259,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Let's eaaaat!",
      "speaker_id": 9001,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7263,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡A comeeeer!"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Let's eaaaat!",
      "speaker_id": 9901,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7277,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡A comeeeer!"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Let's eat...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7291,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "A comer..."
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "What's wrong, Joe? Aren't you\ngonna eat?",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7304,
      "_bytes": 40,
      "translation": "¿Qué pasa, Joe? ¿No vas a\ncomer?"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "...No, that's not it.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7345,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "...No, no es eso."
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "...I was thinking about how we\nwouldn't be going through all this\nif we were at home.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7367,
      "_bytes": 85,
      "translation": "...Pensaba en que no estaríamos\npasando por todo esto si\nestuviéramos en casa."
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "be going through all this if we\nwere at home.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7453,
      "_bytes": 45,
      "translation": "pasar por todo esto si\nestuviéramos en casa."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "be going through all this if we\nwere at home.",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7499,
      "_bytes": 45,
      "translation": "pasar por todo esto si\nestuviéramos en casa."
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 9001,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7545,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "(I have to cheer everyone up!)",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7549,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "(¡Tengo que animar a todos!)"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "...Hey, everyone! What do you like\nto eat over fried eggs?",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7580,
      "_bytes": 58,
      "translation": "...¡Eh, todos! ¿Qué os gusta comer\ncon los huevos fritos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "I eat my eggs with salt and\npepper! Isn't that how you're\nsupposed to eat them?",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7639,
      "_bytes": 79,
      "translation": "¡Yo los como con sal y pimienta!\n¿No se supone que se comen así?"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "I put soy sauce on mine!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7719,
      "_bytes": 24,
      "translation": "¡Yo echo salsa de soja!"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Mayonnaise.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7744,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "Mayonesa."
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Worcestershire sauce!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7756,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "¡Salsa Worcestershire!"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "I like it with a little soy citrus\nsauce.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7778,
      "_bytes": 41,
      "translation": "Yo con un poco de\nsalsa de soja cítrica."
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "You're all weird!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7820,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "¡Sois rarísimos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "I eat my fried eggs with sugar!\nI like it with fermented soybeans,\ntoo!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7838,
      "_bytes": 71,
      "translation": "¡Yo los tomo con azúcar! ¡Y me\ngustan con soja fermentada,\ntambién!"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "I like it with fermented soybeans,\ntoo!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7910,
      "_bytes": 39,
      "translation": "¡A mí también con soja\nfermentada!"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "I like it with fermented soybeans,\ntoo!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7950,
      "_bytes": 39,
      "translation": "¡A mí también con soja\nfermentada!"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Fermented soybeans?!...",
      "speaker_id": 9001,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7990,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¡¿Soja fermentada?!..."
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Fermented soybeans?!...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8014,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¡¿Soja fermentada?!..."
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Fermented soybeans?!...",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8038,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¡¿Soja fermentada?!..."
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 9001,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8062,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "You put those weird things on your\neggs?",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8066,
      "_bytes": 40,
      "translation": "¿Pones todas esas cosas raras con\nhuevos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "You're only supposed to use salt\nand pepper! Not Worcestershire\nsauce or mayonnaise!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8107,
      "_bytes": 84,
      "translation": "¡Se supone que sólo llevan sal y\npimienta! ¡No Worcestershire, ni\nmayonesa!"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Joe, you're so stubborn. You're\nalways worrying about the little\nthings...",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8192,
      "_bytes": 74,
      "translation": "Joe, eres muy tozudo. Siempre te\npreocupas por esas nimiedades..."
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "What do you mean, stubborn?!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8267,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "¡¿Cómo que tozudo?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "See, look! You get angry, just\nlike that!",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8296,
      "_bytes": 41,
      "translation": "¿Ves? ¡Mira! ¡Hasta te enfadas,\nfíjate!"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Hey, Joe! Calm down!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8338,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "¡Eh, Joe! ¡Cálmate!"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Be quiet! I *am* calm! I'm\nalways...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8359,
      "_bytes": 36,
      "translation": "¡Silencio! ¡Estoy calmado!\nSiempre..."
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "You're not acting normal...Are you\ntired?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8396,
      "_bytes": 41,
      "translation": "No estás muy normal...\n¿Estás cansado?"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "I'm not tired! *You* guys are the\nones acting weird here!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8438,
      "_bytes": 57,
      "translation": "¡No estoy cansado! ¡Vosotros sois\nlos raros aquí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Joe...",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8496,
      "_bytes": 6,
      "translation": "Joe..."
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "I've got it together. I...I've got\nit together!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8503,
      "_bytes": 47,
      "translation": "Estoy bien. ¡Estoy... estoy\nbien!"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Honestly, Joe...I wish he'd ease\nup a little. He's always like\nthis...",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8551,
      "_bytes": 70,
      "translation": "Francamente, ojalá Joe se\nrelajase un poco. Siempre está\nigual..."
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "...We've got no choice but to go!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8622,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "...¡No tenemos más opción que ir!"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "No, there's got to be a safer way!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8656,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "¡No, tiene que haber un modo mejor!"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "What's going on? What are they\nfighting about?",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8691,
      "_bytes": 46,
      "translation": "¿Qué ocurre? ¿Por qué están\ndiscutiendo?"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "They're fighting over whether or\nnot we should go up that mountain \nover there, Infinity Mountain.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8738,
      "_bytes": 98,
      "translation": "Discuten si deberíamos subir o no\na esa montaña, Monte Mugen."
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "If we go up there, we'll get a\ngood view of the area! If we\nchicken out, we're just stuck!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8837,
      "_bytes": 90,
      "translation": "¡Si vamos allí, tendremos una\nbuena vista del área! ¡Siendo unos\ngallinas, aquí nos quedamos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "You're just charging in blindly...\nYou're going to put all of us in\ndanger!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8928,
      "_bytes": 75,
      "translation": "Estás avanzando a ciegas...\n¡Nos pondrás a todos en peligro!"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "There are a lot of ferocious\nDigimon on that mountain.",
      "speaker_id": 2321,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9004,
      "_bytes": 54,
      "translation": "Hay muchos Digimon feroces en\nesa montaña."
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Joe! Stop them!",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9059,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Joe! ¡Detenlos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Hey! Let's calm down and talk this\nover!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9075,
      "_bytes": 40,
      "translation": "¡Eh! ¡Calmémonos un poco y \nhablemos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Then what do *you* think, Joe?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9116,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "¿Entonces tú qué piensas, Joe?"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Who do you agree with?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9147,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "¿Quién lleva razón?"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Eh!?",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9170,
      "_bytes": 4,
      "translation": "¡¿Eh?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "(We can survey the area if we go \nup that mountain, but there's \nferocious Digimon out there.)",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9175,
      "_bytes": 94,
      "translation": "(Podemos investigar el área si\nvamos a la montaña, pero hay\nDigimon feroces allí.)"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Both of you are right...I'd say.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9270,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "Diría... que ambos tenéis razón."
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Tai's right...I think.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9303,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "Tai tiene razón... creo."
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Matt's right...I think.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9329,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "Matt tiene razón... Creo."
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Matt's right, you think?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9355,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "¿Matt lleva razón?"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "Matt's right, you think?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9382,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "¿Matt lleva razón?"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 9003,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9409,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Geez, you're unreliable! Anyway,\nlet's go as far as we can!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9413,
      "_bytes": 59,
      "translation": "¡No se puede confiar en nadie!\n¡Venga, vayamos hacia adelante!"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "And I'm saying we shouldn't!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9473,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "¡Y yo digo que no!"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Both of you, listen to me!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9502,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "¡Ambos, escuchadme!"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "See, look!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9529,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Mirad!"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "I'm just trying to think about\neveryone's safety!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9540,
      "_bytes": 49,
      "translation": "¡Sólo estoy pensando en la\nseguridad de todos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "Give it up, Tai.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9590,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "Déjalo, Tai."
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "So then what are we gonna do now?!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9610,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "¡¿Entonces qué vamos a hacer?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Stop! That's enough, all three of\nyou!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9645,
      "_bytes": 38,
      "translation": "¡Alto! ¡Basta! ¡Los tres!"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "It's getting late, so we'll\ncontinue tomorrow!",
      "speaker_id": 2321,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9684,
      "_bytes": 46,
      "translation": "¡Se hace tarde, continuaremos\nmañana!"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "All right, let's turn in for the\nnight!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9731,
      "_bytes": 39,
      "translation": "¡Vale, dejémoslo por esta noche!"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "So that's Infinity Mountain......",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9771,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "Así que ese es el Monte Mugen..."
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "Ferocious Digimon, huh?",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9805,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "Digimon feroces, ¿eh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "...Okay!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9829,
      "_bytes": 8,
      "translation": "...¡Vale!"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "I...I have to keep it together!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9838,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "¡N...no puedo acobardarme!"
